         body='// CertsDemo: runs the five acts\nPki pki = new Pki();\nact1Chain(out, pki);\nact2GoodChain(out, pki);\nact3Refusals(out, pki);\nact4Tampering(out, pki);\nact5Revocation(out, pki);',
