         body='// ChainSteps: the chain check, by hand\nX509Certificate next = i + 1 < chain.size()\n        ? chain.get(i + 1) : root;                  // who should have signed it\nsteps.add(new Step(certificate, next,\n        certificate.getIssuerX500Principal()\n                .equals(next.getSubjectX500Principal()),\n        signedBy(certificate, next),\n        !when.isBefore(certificate.getNotBefore().toInstant())\n                && !when.isAfter(certificate.getNotAfter().toInstant()),\n        i == 0 || certificate.getBasicConstraints() >= 0,   // above the server: a CA\n        !revoked.contains(certificate.getSerialNumber())));',
